ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nXiao Yang and Xiao Bai are members of the class activity planning group, they are discussing the class holiday activities. Xiao Chen is an active member of the class, but never participates in activity planning. Xiao Bai suddenly points at Xiao Chen who is telling jokes in the distance, making a group of people laugh, and winks at Xiao Yang. Then, Xiao Bai winks at Xiao Yang, and both of them laugh.\n\n[Question]\nWhat does Xiao Yang prepare to do?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Xiao Yang finds a quiet place to continue discussing the activity plan with Xiao Bai.\nB. Invites Xiao Chen to share more jokes with other classmates.\nC. Xiao Yang plans with Xiao Bai to turn the holiday activity into a joke competition.\nD. Xiao Yang invites Xiao Chen to participate in the planning of class holiday activities.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0017006690564217834,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e0a1d6006945d27fc9b1","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367649323,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:27:29","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"1e65e4a7d5ec472b923f6c6645be1431"}